          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#classifying_frobenius_algebras Classifying Frobenius Algebras
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frobenius+algebra"} Frobenius structures
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite-dimensional+Hilbert+space"} finite-dimensional Hilbert spaces
            can be classified via
            = succeed "-algebras." do
